<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p data-start="228" data-end="236" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi Team,</p>
<p data-start="238" data-end="333" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Good news - the quote -&nbsp;{!Quote.Name} has been reviewed and officially approved!</p><p data-start="238" data-end="333" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="238" data-end="333" style=""><font face="arial">{!Quote.Link}</font></p><p data-start="238" data-end="333" style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></p>
<p data-start="335" data-end="478" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thanks to everyone who provided input. We can now proceed with the next steps as planned.</p>
<p data-start="480" data-end="633" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please make sure all relevant teams are looped in, and let me know if any additional documentation or actions are needed on my end to keep things moving.</p>
<p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Appreciate the collaboration as always - let’s get this show on the road!</p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p data-start="635" data-end="708" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://solmillenium2--partial.sandbox.file.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015be000002tyAT&amp;oid=00Dbe000000ANL7" border="0" align="left" alt=""><br></p>]]></td>
